 "intactCut": {
  "why": "Tyler rejected the fourth cut (2026-09-05): the arm joins still failed in live play -- detached, severed, an extra limb, a floating forearm. Ruling: stop the cut-arm -> extend -> rotate method; the profile upper body, coat, shoulders and arms stay one intact authored silhouette while walking.",
  "whyArticulationAbandoned": "four cuts of puppet-style arm articulation each moved the seam rather than removing it: a piece cut from the coat and rotated shows its cut, and a piece extended to hide the cut shows the extension. At gameplay scale the walk is judged on continuity, not on arm swing.",
  "upperBodySource": {
   "path": "art/actors/thad-stand-right/stand-00.png",
   "sha256": "8c4373e9e60e354434f9e2445ccf02dfdf232e71a6199c7b7f22f9085b1b9c62",
   "rowsUsed": "0..434 (the coat's lowest hem row)",
